{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Finding yourself out of food, you decide to venture into the outdoors for the first time in an embarrassingly long time in order to satiate your growing hunger.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3043280/extras/kickdababy.gif?t=1750263354\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Legend of the Corndog(s)</strong> is a First-Person, Open World Experience that <strong><i><u>thrives</u></i></strong> on not taking itself seriously.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>Believe us, we're just as shocked as you are.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3043280/extras/petpetpet.gif?t=1750263354\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features Include:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- <i>Talk to the Locals!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-\u00a0<i><span class=\"bb_strike\">DO NOT</span> Pet the Dog!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- <i>Make Shop Vendors lives Miserable!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- <i>Experience the pain of a thousand deaths!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- <i>Visit Strange Places!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- <i>And more we cannot discuss without legal approval!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3043280/extras/rollingdowndahill.gif?t=1750263354\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3043280?t=1750263354","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3043280?t=17502633